# Scope

PDHPI is a complementary defense layer.

## It does

- Score real inbound requests
- Track rate, reputation, and session correlation
- Return allow / challenge / block
- Enforce a proof-of-work challenge
- Rotate a transport envelope
- Run calibrated short-horizon predictions

## It does not

- Replace a WAF or RASP
- Fix insecure application code
- Guarantee zero false positives
- Invent demo traffic

Use it for cheap, correlated, per-request signal — not as a full security stack.
